00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:40.894 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:43.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess I'm trying to think of
-- I feel like --

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:47.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
do you feel like you have
more recognizable happier face

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
