I don't know. Do you?

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know.
I think I would be --

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:56.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think
that's more recognizable.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.178
I think you'd get me more there.
