00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:03.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think this is
worse for me than this.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:06.619
-Yeah, when the sort of
eye-based pandemic starts

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:10.190
